Insight: The conjecture's "unique scale-invariant fixed point iff threshold bounded away
  from zero" is, in the linearized regime, the *clean equivalence* `tendsto ↔ factor < 1`.
  The homological side (`ker ∂* ∂ = ker ∂`) is the discrete Hodge theorem and needs only
  the inner-product identity `⟪∂* ∂ x, x⟫ = ‖∂ x‖²`.
